cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CleanRhizo in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CleanRhizo: a browser-based tool for WinRhizo root morphology data cleaning and exploration"
abstract: "CleanRhizo is a free, browser-based application for cleaning, organizing and exploring root morphology data exported from WinRhizo (Regent Instruments). It runs entirely in the browser via WebR and shinylive: it selects columns, removes sub-header rows, decodes treatments and replicates from sample identifiers, and produces tidy datasets in wide or long format with exploratory bar charts."
